      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabGRqVndaWE10UW5Zd00waHlkMUI1UW5sbFVWRRAB!2m1!1s0x2e69ed006dff60bf:0xcbdbacd882bd6557"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJv2D_bQDtaS4RV2W9gtis28s/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KWFJHbGhkRzVQUm5Od1EyOU5abk5tYUY5cExWRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I must say that it’s rare to find a café this nice in East Jakarta. The food is good. I tried both the sweet French toast and the savory one with beef, and both were delicious.\n\nThe space is also great for working. They have Wi-Fi (a bit unstable at times, but still good enough for doing documents, since I didn’t try the connection for zoom) plus plenty of power outlets. Parking is convenient too, with spaces both in front of and behind the café.\n\nThey also have a musholla and clean restrooms upstairs, which is a big plus. Overall, it’s very suitable for WFC. Just a heads up, it can get quite busy and noisy during peak weekend hours, but the service is very attentive.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I must say that it’s rare to find a café this nice in East Jakarta. The food is good. I tried both the sweet French toast and the savory one with beef, and both were delicious.\n\nThe space is also great for working. They have Wi-Fi (a bit unstable at times, but still good enough for doing documents, since I didn’t try the connection for zoom) plus plenty of power outlets. Parking is convenient too, with spaces both in front of and behind the café.\n\nThey also have a musholla and clean restrooms upstairs, which is a big plus. Overall, it’s very suitable for WFC. Just a heads up, it can get quite busy and noisy during peak weekend hours, but the service is very attentive.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
